# Noibu

> Noibu is the ecommerce analytics and monitoring platform that helps retailers protect and grow online revenue. We unite error monitoring, site performance, and experience analytics in one platform — giving ecommerce, product, technical, UX, and CX teams a shared view of what's happening on their site and what it's costing.

## Platform capabilities

- [Issues & Alerts](https://www.noibu.com/product/issues-and-alerts): Spot critical issues before they impact revenue.
- [Sessions](https://www.noibu.com/product/sessions): Capture full user journeys for every site visit.
- [Performance Monitoring](https://www.noibu.com/product/performance-monitoring): Improve site health, speed, and slowdowns.
- [Release Monitoring](https://www.noibu.com/product/release-monitoring): Know exactly what changed after every release.
- [Page Analysis](https://www.noibu.com/product/page-analysis): Visualize how users interact with each page.

